{"id":"en_unblinded-my-girlfriend-and-i-slay-all","title":"Unblinded: My Girlfriend and I Slay All","titleEn":"Unblinded: My Girlfriend and I Slay All","description":"In 1920s Tijuana, Eileen is a blind heiress whose sight returns, revealing a devastating truth: her husband Rick, a crooked police chief, killed her father, took her inheritance, and imprisoned her son. She hides the fact that she can see and begins planning her revenge. At a racetrack she crosses paths with Rosie, a tough street girl, and the two join forces to free her son, growing closer as they do. They lure Rick into a trap that also draws in U.S. Magistrate Eldridge. In the final confrontation they outmaneuver him through a faked death, slip over the border, and start a new life on the California coast.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/unblinded-my-girlfriend-and-i-slay-all/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/unblinded-my-girlfriend-and-i-slay-all/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Plot Twist","Revenge","Wolf in Disguise","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doguy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_unblinded-my-girlfriend-and-i-slay-all_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doguy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_unblinded-my-girlfriend-and-i-slay-all_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doguy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_unblinded-my-girlfriend-and-i-slay-all_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doguy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downl